X:1
T: He Keeps Me Singing
C: Words: Luther B. Bridgers, 1910.
C: Music: 'He Keeps Me Singing' or 'Melody of Love' Hans Engelmann, 1903.
C: Setting: "The Revival No. 6", Luther B. Bridgers, 1910.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2015 Revision.
S: Music source: "Tabernacle Hymns, Issue 2", 1921 Hymn 13.
